"1844B, In this problem the idea is to realise that mex of any array that dosent have 1 is 1, and any array that dosent have 2 is 2.. because the definition of mex is smallest positive integer that is not present in the array. So our goal is to create an array that have the highest amount of sub-arrays with mex as a prime number. The array sould have 1 to n numbers in it, in other words the array should be a permutation of n. "